---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Nav from '../components/Nav.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" description="About ITC Environmental and founder Zach Heiden — environmental testing and certification based in Indianapolis, IN.">
  <Nav />

  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Who We Are</p>
      <h1>About ITC Environmental</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="about-main">
    <div class="container about-grid">
      <div class="about-photo">
        <div class="about-img-wrap">
          <img src="/images/actionshots/cleanroom-hepa-ceiling-scan.jpg" alt="ITC Environmental technician performing cleanroom HEPA ceiling scan" />
        </div>
        <div class="about-card">
          <p class="card-label">Founder &amp; Owner</p>
          <p class="card-name">Zach Heiden</p>
          <p class="card-detail">Indianapolis, IN</p>
          <a href="mailto:zheiden@itc-environmental.com" class="card-email">zheiden@itc-environmental.com</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="about-copy">
        <h2>Built for Critical Environments. Focused on Getting It Right.</h2>
        <p>ITC Environmental provides testing and certification services for the facilities where compliance isn't optional — hospital pharmacies, compounding pharmacies, research laboratories, and pharmaceutical production environments. Every service is performed to applicable regulatory standards, with documentation that holds up to inspection.</p>
        <p>Based in Indianapolis, ITC serves facilities across the country with a focus on markets where large national firms tend to underdeliver. Our approach is straightforward: assess what your facility needs, perform the work to standard, and provide complete documentation on the way out.</p>
        <p>Zach Heiden founded ITC Environmental in 2024 after more than a decade working in environmental testing and certification. That background drives how ITC operates — methodical, technically sound, and focused on the details that regulators and accreditation bodies actually look for.</p>

        <div class="values-list">
          <div class="value-item">
            <h3>Direct Communication</h3>
            <p>No ticketing systems or account managers. You work with the same contact from quote to completion.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-item">
            <h3>High Repeat Rate</h3>
            <p>A significant share of ITC's clients return for annual and semi-annual recertification. That's the benchmark that matters.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="value-item">
            <h3>Emergency Response</h3>
            <p>When a critical environment goes down, ITC can mobilize quickly. Compliance timelines don't follow business hours.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-primary">Get in Touch →</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    background:
      linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(31,53,96,0.82) 0%, rgba(31,53,96,0.65) 100%),
      url('/images/actionshots/bsc-hepa-probe-scan.jpg') 60% 30%/cover no-repeat;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 5rem 0 4rem;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 2rem;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.8125rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--teal-light);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .about-main {
    padding: 5rem 0;
  }

  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 320px 1fr;
    gap: 5rem;
    align-items: start;
  }

  .about-photo {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    position: sticky;
    top: 100px;
  }

  .about-img-wrap {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 3/4;
    border-radius: 8px;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-img-wrap img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center top;
    display: block;
  }


  .about-card {
    background: var(--off-white);
    border-radius: 8px;
    padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.25rem;
  }

  .card-label {
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--teal);
  }

  .card-name {
    font-size: 1.125rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
  }

  .card-detail {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--slate);
  }

  .card-email {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--teal);
    margin-top: 0.25rem;
  }

  .card-email:hover {
    text-decoration: underline;
  }

  .about-copy h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
  }

  .about-copy p {
    color: var(--slate);
    line-height: 1.8;
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
    font-size: 1rem;
  }

  .values-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.5rem;
    margin: 2.5rem 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    padding-top: 2.5rem;
  }

  .value-item h3 {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--navy);
    margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
  }

  .value-item p {
    margin-bottom: 0;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
  }

  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.75rem 1.5rem;
    border-radius: 4px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.9375rem;
    transition: all 0.2s;
    border: 2px solid transparent;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--teal);
    color: #fff;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--teal-light);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }

    .about-photo {
      position: static;
      flex-direction: row;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }

    .about-img-wrap {
      width: 160px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }


    .about-card {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 200px;
    }
  }
</style>
